Aelix Studio host
https://github.com/handochan/aelix-studio-host

This is a modified version of AionCore (https://github.com/iOfficeAI/AionCore).
The LICENSE file is the license text distributed with the upstream repository.

Changes made for Aelix Studio are recorded as commits on top of the upstream
base named in scripts/release/policy.json. Each release's provenance file names
that upstream base commit and the release commit. The README lists the
categories of modification.

This host includes a modified aion-mcp from iOfficeAI/aionrs v0.2.11
(commit 8e61a90329fa9f67c4fdf7e97fe02c24dba33f75). The original license
is retained in vendor/aion-mcp/LICENSE. See vendor/aion-mcp/UPSTREAM.md
for source and change details.

This host includes a modified aws-config 1.13.0 from the AWS SDK for Rust.
The original license is retained in vendor/aws-config/LICENSE. See
vendor/aws-config/UPSTREAM.md for the source pin and Host changes.
